<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Free LS swap guides for the Hyundai Genesis Coupe (BK1 and BK2): engine choice, mounts, wiring, Holley ECU, cooling, drivetrain, and real build photos.">
  <Hero
    title="LS Swap Genesis Coupe Guides"
    subtitle="Real build notes from years of community work — wiring, mounts, cooling, Holley, and everything in between."
